by check mark whether the registrant is an emerging growth company as defined in Rule 405 of the Securities Act of 1933 or Rule 12b-2
of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Emerging
growth company&#160;&#160;&#160;<span id="xdx_90A_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260713__20260713_zzFKfdjS2z7g"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-07-13" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000033" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

